<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Goodbeat | Creative marketing for medical aesthetics</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f7f3ec;--ink:#1f2a3b;--navy:#2d3a4f;--clay:#a65f45;--sand:#e5ddcf;--gold:#d9b24f;--line:rgba(31,42,59,.2);--onnavy:#f7f3ec;
--serif:'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;--sans:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#171f2c;--ink:#f1ece2;--sand:#2a3648;--line:rgba(241,236,226,.22)}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#171f2c;--ink:#f1ece2;--sand:#2a3648;--line:rgba(241,236,226,.22)}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}
h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.serif{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.small{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}
.link{display:inline-flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:5px;transition:gap .2s}
.link:hover{gap:40px}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:64px}
.logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.nav ul{display:flex;gap:34px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:12px}
.nav a:hover{color:var(--clay)}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:56px;padding:88px 0 64px;align-items:end}
.hero .small{display:block;margin-bottom:34px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(52px,7.4vw,92px);line-height:.95;margin-bottom:34px}
.hero p{max-width:400px;margin-bottom:34px}
.art{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.05;width:100%}
.art div{position:absolute}
.b-sand{left:0;top:0;width:50%;height:52%;background:var(--sand)}
.b-navy{right:0;top:0;width:50%;height:68%;background:var(--navy)}
.b-clay{left:0;top:30%;width:46%;height:45%;background:var(--clay)}
.b-line{left:12%;top:36%;width:42%;height:42%;border:1px solid rgba(247,243,236,.7)}
.b-sand2{right:4%;bottom:0;width:34%;height:34%;background:var(--sand);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line)}
.b-tag{left:6%;bottom:6%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);padding:6px 12px}
.art-foot{display:block;text-align:right;margin-top:14px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}
.sec{padding:72px 0}
.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;margin-bottom:34px}
.head h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1}
.head p{font-size:12px;opacity:.85;text-align:right}
.rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.rows a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1.2fr 1.3fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);transition:padding-left .2s,background .2s}
.rows a:hover{padding-left:12px;background:rgba(166,95,69,.09)}
.rows .n{font-size:10px;opacity:.6}
.rows .t{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.rows .d{font-size:12px;max-width:300px;opacity:.85}
.phil{background:var(--navy);color:var(--onnavy);padding:84px 0 96px}
.phil .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:40px}
.phil .dash{width:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--gold);margin-top:10px}
.phil h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5.5vw,68px);line-height:1;margin-bottom:46px;max-width:520px}
.phil p{font-size:12px;max-width:300px}
.work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.work a{display:block}
.work .img{aspect-ratio:4/3;margin-bottom:14px;transition:transform .3s;display:flex;align-items:end;padding:14px;color:var(--onnavy)}
.work a:hover .img{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.w1{background:var(--clay)}.w2{background:var(--navy)}.w3{background:var(--sand);color:var(--ink)!important}
.work b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.work i{font-size:12px;opacity:.8}
.why{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start}
.why h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.4vw,52px);line-height:1;margin-bottom:22px}
.why p{max-width:400px}
.pts{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.pts li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
.pts span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;color:var(--clay)}
.cta{background:var(--clay);color:#fff8f0;padding:80px 0}
.cta .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta h2{font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,64px);line-height:1;max-width:620px}
.cta .link{font-size:15px}
footer{padding:28px 0;font-size:12px;opacity:.75}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
@media (max-width:860px){
.wrap{padding:0 24px}
.nav ul{gap:18px}.nav li:nth-child(n+3){display:none}
.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:56px 0 40px;gap:40px}
.head{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}.head p{text-align:left}
.rows a{grid-template-columns:34px 1fr}.rows .d{grid-column:2}
.phil .wrap,.why{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
.work{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.sec{padding:52px 0}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap nav">
  <a class="logo" href="#top">goodbeat</a>
  <ul><li><a href="#services">Services</a></li><li><a href="#work">Work</a></li><li><a href="#about">About</a></li><li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li></ul>
</div></header>
<main id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div>
      <span class="small">Creative marketing for medical aesthetics</span>
      <h1 class="serif">A better kind of growth.</h1>
      <p>Creative marketing for medical aesthetics. From brand and content to campaigns, websites and patient acquisition.</p>
      <a class="link" href="#contact">Let&rsquo;s talk <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract composition of navy, clay and sand shapes">
        <div class="b-sand"></div><div class="b-navy"></div><div class="b-clay"></div><div class="b-line"></div><div class="b-sand2"></div>
        <div class="b-tag small">Editorial image placeholder</div>
      </div>
      <span class="art-foot">Brand / Content / Growth</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="wrap sec" id="services">
    <div class="head"><h2 class="serif">What we do</h2><p>A considered creative partner for ambitious clinics.</p></div>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Brand Strategy &amp; Identity</span><span class="d">A distinctive foundation for how your clinic looks, sounds and feels.</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Content &amp; Social</span><span class="d">Considered storytelling that builds connection over time.</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Paid Media</span><span class="d">Thoughtful campaigns made to reach the right people.</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Website Design</span><span class="d">Digital experiences that make a compelling first impression.</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">Patient Acquisition</span><span class="d">A clearer path from first interest to meaningful enquiry.</span></a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="phil"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="dash"></div>
    <div><h2 class="serif">Good work. Better outcomes.</h2><p>The right ideas make every part of the patient journey feel more considered.</p></div>
  </div></div>

  <section class="wrap sec" id="work">
    <div class="head"><h2 class="serif">Selected work</h2><p>Case studies are on the way.</p></div>
    <div class="work">
      <a href="#contact"><div class="img w1 small">Case study 01</div><b>Clinic name</b><i>Brand, Content</i></a>
      <a href="#contact"><div class="img w2 small">Case study 02</div><b>Clinic name</b><i>Paid Media, Social</i></a>
      <a href="#contact"><div class="img w3 small">Case study 03</div><b>Clinic name</b><i>Website, Patient Acquisition</i></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap sec why" id="about">
    <div><h2 class="serif">A smaller agency, by design.</h2><p>We keep things focused and collaborative, so you get thoughtful strategy, beautiful content and a team that cares about your growth.</p></div>
    <ul class="pts">
      <li><span>&mdash;</span>Specialists in medical aesthetics</li>
      <li><span>&mdash;</span>Strategy, creative and execution in one team</li>
      <li><span>&mdash;</span>Real support, not just reporting</li>
      <li><span>&mdash;</span>A long-term partner in your growth</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="cta" id="contact"><div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="serif">Build a brand more people believe in.</h2>
    <a class="link" href="mailto:hello@goodbeat.co">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
  </div></div>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap"><span>&copy; 2026 Goodbeat</span><span>Creative marketing for medical aesthetics</span></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
